  triage:description "boundary_adapters.rs test inbox_projection_stub_reexport_preserves_logical_identity uses claude_jsonl_body_export_max_bytes = 0 (stub-only). The no-churn proof is missing for the default-cap path (128 KiB) where small messages receive full-body export. Add a second reexport-idempotency test using the default cap (large cap or omit .atm.toml), send small message, re-export twice, verify notification fingerprint is stable (no duplicate notifications / churn) when full body is the projection." ;
